  "abstract": "Test a robust loss on the simple Fourier LN ScalarRamp baseline: replace MAE with Huber(\u03b4=0.01) across (B,32,N), keeping curvature \u03bb=1e\u22124, Adam lr=9e\u22124, clip=1.0, drop=0.05, p=36, H=128, learn_gamma=False. Hypothesis: reduce heavy-tail influence without harming early steps.",
